{"5007910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Metro Resonance", "steam_appid": 5007910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>                                                                               HISTORY</strong>                                                                               </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Station Zero has been wiped out... You are the last hope for the survivors. You have a dying partner in your arms and a single vial of life-saving serum. You have <strong>30 minutes</strong> before Haven Station is sealed forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras/ff20e37325835021509507912446d5d0.avif?t=1787660800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras_big/ff20e37325835021509507912446d5d0.avif?t=1787660800 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE THE DARK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Scarcity is Real</strong> Ammo is extremely rare, your flashlight requires manual charging, and your gas mask filter is slowly clogging up with soot. </i><strong>Claustrophobic Tension</strong> Explore ghost trains listening to the protagonist's raw inner thoughts and the eerie sounds of the underground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras/79ecc3f1167d293b12b224276a79309a.avif?t=1787660800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras_big/79ecc3f1167d293b12b224276a79309a.