 mask filter is slowly clogging up with soot. </i><strong>Claustrophobic Tension</strong> Explore ghost trains listening to the protagonist's raw inner thoughts and the eerie sounds of the underground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras/79ecc3f1167d293b12b224276a79309a.avif?t=1787660800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras_big/79ecc3f1167d293b12b224276a79309a.avif?t=1787660800 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE DANGER BELOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate collapsing tunnels, radiation pockets, and hostile ambushes. Adaptation and speed are your only chances to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras/5055f57cdaead5ba8ce1f9374ccb8540.avif?t=1787660800\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/extras_big/5055f57cdaead5ba8ce1f9374ccb8540.avif?t=1787660800 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An intense 30-minute first-person survival thriller set in a post-apocalyptic underground. Survive a pitch-black tunnel, gather spare parts to fix your handcar, and reach the sealing station before your gas mask filter runs out.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/997d99fad7013bfbc557eb90afb51963a5ed293f/header.jpg?t=1787660800", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007910/9b2666f9724e3ea752a134560057809129225364/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787660800", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as